The '''Ice Path''' is a path ascending up a mountain, in the [[Troll Country]] region of [[Gielinor]]. It has no purpose other than the part it plays during the [[Desert Treasure I#Ice diamond|ice diamond section]] of the [[Desert Treasure I]] quest and a location for a [[Treasure Trails/Guide/Cryptic clues/Master|master cryptic clue]] on a [[Clue scroll (master)|master clue scroll]]. It is extremely dangerous, and players are advised not to enter unless prepared. The entrance to the path is barred with a gate and players may only pass if they have given the [[troll child]] a ([[Chocolate cake|chocolate]]) [[cake]] during the Desert Treasure I quest. After that, the player can freely go through the gate at any time. West of the [[Ice gate|Ice Gate]] is the entrance to [[Trollweiss Dungeon]].

Because of the extremely cold conditions, players cannot run after passing the [[Ice gate|Ice Gate]] (although this effect can be countered by using [[stamina potion]]s). The area's [[chill]] effect also drains your [[Hitpoints]] periodically by 1-2 and other stats in the same fashion by one. However, this effect stops draining your Hitpoints once you have only 1 left. Towards the end of the path, after defeating [[Kamil]], players must use [[spiked boots]] on the ice shelf to be able to walk at all; however, they may still slip and fall several times, taking damage.

[[File:Ice Gate.png|thumb|The imposing Ice Gate.|none]]

==Monsters==
*[[Ice troll]] (level 120-124)
*[[Ice Wolf]] (level 134)
*[[Kamil]] (level 154)

